s7-6-p26 : Block
s7-6-p26 = prose (cons "The finite block contract of §9.3 ends at a postcondition. A continuing computation instead has a guarded process as its observation. For a code image \(C\) and admitted target state \(s\), the target's instruction transition system defines a process over its *remaining* system-command signature \(\Sigma_{\mathrm{sys}}\):" nil)
